    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b0be9d6340b45a4bfea5ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "告诉更多的人这世界上存在着美妙的惊喜。\n我想帮助她，让她单纯的愿望能够实现。所以──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9673b3ef05a4418eee1608cfa68d5bb0a1716919f2557b9a7bb25388b79262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
